# git checkout on Windows rewrites these to CRLF.
# GitHub "Download ZIP" does not: it serves the git blob, which is LF when the
# repo is maintained on macOS or Linux. StartChrome*.cmd repairs that at startup
# via EnsureCmdLineEndings.ps1, which must stay in the same folder as the .cmd files.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
